  "description": "Kasen City 2.0 Electric Bike - 500W Motor, 28 MPH, 55-Mile Range, 6061 Aluminum Frame, Hydraulic Fork, Removable Samsung Battery\nWhy Choose the Kasen City 2.0?\nKasen City 2.0 Electric Bike – The Ultimate Urban Commuter E-Bike. The Kasen City 2.0 is the ultimate e-bike for urban commuters, combining power, comfort, and versatility in one sleek package. Whether you're navigating city streets, running errands, or exploring new trails, this e-bike is built to handle it all. With its removable Samsung battery, hydraulic suspension fork, and high-performance motor, the Kasen City 2.0 offers unmatched value for riders seeking a reliable and stylish electric bike.\nExperience the perfect blend of power, performance, and style with the Kasen City 2.0 Electric Bike. Designed for urban commuters and adventure seekers, this e-bike features a 500W brushless rear hub motor that delivers speeds of up to 28 MPH with pedal assist and 20 MPH with throttle. With a removable 48V Samsung lithium-ion battery (15AH or 20AH options), enjoy a 45-55 mile range per charge, making it ideal for daily commutes or weekend rides.\n\n6061 Double-Butted Aluminum Alloy Frame: Lightweight, durable, and built to last, with an integrated internal battery for a sleek design.\n\nHydraulic Fork with 100mm Travel: Smooth rides on any terrain, featuring lockout and preload adjustment for added comfort.\n\nTektro Hydraulic Disc Brakes: Reliable stopping power with 180mm front and 160mm rear disc brakes for safety in all conditions.\n\nDigitech BC182 Backlit LCD Display: Monitor your speed, battery life, and distance with ease. Includes a USB port for charging devices on the go.\n\n5-Level Pedal Assist & Thumb Throttle: Customize your ride with intelligent pedal assist and effortless throttle control.\n\n27.5\" x 2.4\" CST Tires: Tackle city streets and light trails with confidence, paired with double-wall aluminum rims for added durability.\n\nIntegrated Accessories: Includes a front aluminum basket, rear rack (50lbs capacity), and full-coverage fenders for practicality and style.\n\nErgonomic Design: Features ergonomic grips, a comfortable Kasen saddle, and a quick-release seat clamp for easy adjustments.\n\nElectric bike for adults\n\n500W e-bike\n\nUrban commuter e-bike\n\nRemovable battery e-bike\n\n28 MPH electric bike\n\n55-mile range e-bike\n\nHydraulic fork e-bike\n\nShimano 7-speed e-bike\n\nTektro hydraulic disc brakes\n\nSamsung battery e-bike\n\nBest electric bike for city riding\n\nAffordable e-bike with high performance\n\nLightweight aluminum frame e-bike\n\nE-bike with front basket and rear rack\nLong-range electric bike",
